 "uncertain": [
  "League-average defense (Range C, Error 3) is an assumption. The rulebook does not define it.",
  "The 26 parks are drawn uniformly. The book does not define a league-average park.",
  "TOUGH-OUT is not shifted. Face 00 is not shifted. Page 11 is not combined with page 39 and is not emitted on these cards.",
  "A reached-on-error is an at-bat and not a hit. The two logged tournament DEFENSE plays are an out and a rare-play catcher's interference, so they do not show a SINGLE+error being scored as a hit.",
  "Dropped fouls are renormalized out of the completed plate appearance. A defense park-percentile 00 is an out inside the plate appearance.",
  "Card-implied rates use the frozen pitcher mix, not a sampled staff. The 215 rulebook sim uses the converted tournament pitchers, which is a different and lower-offense environment than the 1986 accuracy opponents.",
  "Switch-hitter ballpark share uses the solver hand split 0.28/0.72.",
  "Comp selection (8 qualified 1986 cards) is a judgment. IN-PLAY is the fallback when every comp printed none of an outcome.",
  "Williams wheel triples stay 8 faces versus left-handers. The rate matches his window. The width is what that rare section requires.",
  "Barry Bonds wheel is home runs on faces 1-99 both hands. There is no room left for a double in WHEELHOUSE.",
  "Intentional walks are excluded from the walk target, so card-implied OBP sits under the real OBP that counts them.",
  "1986 accuracy plate appearances are AB+BB. Batters faced are IP*3+H+BB."
 ]
